  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></munderover><msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>r</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>78</mi></math><br />Again, coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn></math><br />Constant term in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>.<br />Thus, the required coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> (coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>) in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo></math>constant term in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>78</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>106</mn></math>."
